==Norwegian Bokmål==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nb|da|øje}}, replaced native {{m|nb|aue}}, from {{inh|nb|gmq-oda|øghæ}}, from {{inh|nb|non|auga}}, from {{inh|nb|gem-pro|*augô}}, ultimately from {{inh|nb|ine-pro|*h₃ekʷ-||eye; to see}}. Cognate with {{cog|nn|auga}}, {{m|nn|auge}}, {{cog|is|auga}}, {{cog|fo|eyga}} and {{cog|sv|öga}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|nb|/ˈœ̂ʏ̯ə/}}

